  "description": "I reincarnated as the wife of a cursed archduke in my own twisted novel. As the author, I took responsibility and set things right by lifting the curse, which was the key to returning home. I thought my job was done, and just when I was finally trying to go back, the archduke asked me, *\"Did you really think I wouldn't know that you’re planning on returning to your fiance?\".* \n\nHe had completely misunderstood! \n\n*\"Whether you like it or not, I'm still your husband. I'm never letting you go back to that bastard.\"* \n\nAll I want is for him to please let me go home!",
